{"schema":"hsr-dialogue.v1","entryId":"unknowable-domain","chapterId":"event-rogue-27","referenceCommit":"312b4597691e0a29cf9828a15b592757dba86949","textReferenceCommit":"74a7b96fba32f00cf495a5c00b0311bd02207aaf","sourceIds":["event-rogue-27"],"missing":0,"rows":[{"id":"unknowable-domain-event-rogue-27-talk-403812001-line","entryId":"unknowable-domain","chapterId":"event-rogue-27","missionId":"event-rogue-27","mission":"바운티 헌터","scene":"바운티 헌터","type":"dialogue","speaker":"시뮬레이션 우주","text":"따뜻한 모피를 감싼 채로 설원을 걷다가 어떤 남자와 마주친다. 빨간색 곱슬머리와 주근깨를 가진 그는 크고 말랐으며 소가죽 장화를 신은 채 사냥용 총을 메고 있다","talkId":403812001,"textHash":"14436452707738454799","source":"rogueHandBookEvent:27/talk-403812001","flowStatus":"review","bwikiStatus":"cached","bwikiScene":"a074f5db62a32b02","bwikiNextIds":["unknowable-domain-event-rogue-27-talk-403812002-line"],"bwikiPage":"赏金猎人","bwikiRevision":58162,"bwikiMissionId":"bwiki-page-9299","bwikiMission":"바운티 헌터"},{"id":"unknowable-domain-event-rogue-27-talk-403812002-line","entryId":"unknowable-domain","chapterId":"event-rogue-27","missionId":"event-rogue-27","mission":"바운티 헌터","scene":"바운티 헌터","type":"dialogue","speaker":"시뮬레이션 우주","text":"그가 먼 곳에 위치한 구형 건축물을 가리킨다. 「스타피스 컴퍼니의 제약 회사가 스노데얀에서 생물 재료를 포획해 진귀한 약품을 만들기 위해 대량의 바운티 헌터를 모집하고 있어」","talkId":403812002,"textHash":"15125173958229498379","source":"rogueHandBookEvent:27/talk-403812002","flowStatus":"review","bwikiStatus":"cached","bwikiScene":"a074f5db62a32b02","bwikiNextIds":["unknowable-domain-event-rogue-27-talk-403812003-line"],"bwikiPage":"赏金猎人","bwikiRevision":58162,"bwikiMissionId":"bwiki-page-9299","bwikiMission":"바운티 헌터"},{"id":"unknowable-domain-event-rogue-27-talk-403812003-line","entryId":"unknowable-domain","chapterId":"event-rogue-27","missionId":"event-rogue-27","mission":"바운티 헌터","scene":"바운티 헌터","type":"dialogue","speaker":"시뮬레이션 우주","text":"「이건 비밀정보야. S급 모집——설원 심경 야크를 포획 시 최고급 보수를 지급한다. 그런데 여긴 왜 이리 추운 거야, 네 모피를 좀 빌릴 수 있을까?」 그의 가슴팍에 있는 *스노데얀 동물 보호 협회* 배지에 눈길이 간다…","talkId":403812003,"textHash":"6582669703368238722","source":"rogueHandBookEvent:27/talk-403812003","flowStatus":"review","bwikiStatus":"cached","bwikiScene":"a074f5db62a32b02","bwikiNextIds":[],"bwikiPage":"赏金猎人","bwikiRevision":58162,"bwikiMissionId":"bwiki-page-9299","bwikiMission":"바운티 헌터"},{"id":"unknowable-domain-event-rogue-27-text-14940271520825365590-choice","entryId":"unknowable-domain","chapterId":"event-rogue-27","missionId":"event-rogue-27","mission":"바운티 헌터","scene":"바운티 헌터","type":"choice","speaker":"","text":"몸에 걸친 모피를 그에게 준다","talkId":null,"textHash":"14940271520825365590","source":"rogueHandBookEvent:27/text-14940271520825365590","flowStatus":"review","bwikiStatus":"cached","bwikiScene":"89ab322e38ceef84","bwikiNextIds":[],"bwikiPage":"赏金猎人","bwikiRevision":58162,"bwikiMissionId":"bwiki-page-9299","bwikiMission":"바운티 헌터"},{"id":"unknowable-domain-event-rogue-27-text-7345296867986712579-choice","entryId":"unknowable-domain","chapterId":"event-rogue-27","missionId":"event-rogue-27","mission":"바운티 헌터","scene":"바운티 헌터","type":"choice","speaker":"","text":"상대에게서 더 많은 *정보*를 얻는다","talkId":null,"textHash":"7345296867986712579","source":"rogueHandBookEvent:27/text-7345296867986712579","flowStatus":"review","bwikiStatus":"cached","bwikiScene":"2824c2dfe5d57002","bwikiNextIds":[],"bwikiPage":"赏金猎人","bwikiRevision":58162,"bwikiMissionId":"bwiki-page-9299","bwikiMission":"바운티 헌터"}],"orderNote":"공식 사건 도감에 귀속된 한국어 원문입니다. BWIKI에서 확인한 모드별 구간만 연결하며 조건·확률·미확인 경계는 이어 붙이지 않습니다.","bwikiBaseOrder":["unknowable-domain-event-rogue-27-talk-403812001-line","unknowable-domain-event-rogue-27-talk-403812002-line","unknowable-domain-event-rogue-27-talk-403812003-line","unknowable-domain-event-rogue-27-text-14940271520825365590-choice","unknowable-domain-event-rogue-27-text-7345296867986712579-choice"],"bwiki":{"matchedRows":0,"cachedRows":5,"reviewRows":0,"segments":3,"reorderedRows":0},"retainedTextRowIds":[]}